#. module: ssi_school_fee_waiver_deduction
#: code:addons/ssi_school_fee_waiver_deduction/models/school_enrollment.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Finish enrollment\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Fee waiver deduction '%s' allocated to this enrollment's own invoice is still Draft/Waiting for Approval\n"
"Solution: Confirm and finish that deduction before finishing this enrollment\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Menyelesaikan pendaftaran\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Potongan keringanan biaya '%s' yang dialokasikan ke faktur pendaftaran ini masih berstatus Draf/Menunggu Persetujuan\n"
"Solusi: Konfirmasi dan selesaikan potongan tersebut sebelum menyelesaikan pendaftaran ini\n"

