#. module: ssi_school_fee_waiver_deduction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_fee_waiver_deduction.field_school_fee_waiver_deduction__recognition_method
msgid ""
"``immediate`` books every Line straight to its own Account when this "
"document is finished. ``enrollment`` instead books every Line to the Waiver "
"Type's own Deferred Discount Account, deferring recognition to the "
"enrollment's own Revenue Recognition entry. Set by "
"``_03_apply_enrollment_recognition`` when this document is finished; never "
"set by the user."
msgstr "``immediate`` membukukan setiap Baris langsung ke Akun-nya sendiri saat dokumen ini diselesaikan. ``enrollment`` sebaliknya membukukan setiap Baris ke Akun Diskon Ditangguhkan milik Jenis Keringanan, dengan menunda pengakuan ke entri Pengakuan Pendapatan milik pendaftaran. Ditetapkan oleh ``_03_apply_enrollment_recognition`` saat dokumen ini diselesaikan; tidak pernah ditetapkan oleh pengguna."
